WEBVTT

00:09:00.000 --> 00:09:01.809
is the unifying theme

00:09:01.833 --> 00:09:04.934
for every talk you have seen so far at TED

00:09:04.958 --> 00:09:08.226
and will continue as we of course embark

00:09:08.250 --> 00:09:13.476
on this journey here on this tiny planet,

00:09:13.500 --> 00:09:16.601
on the ledge, on the precipice,

00:09:16.625 --> 00:09:20.059
as we are seeing, yes,
death is inevitable.

00:09:20.083 --> 00:09:22.684
(Laughter)

00:09:22.708 --> 00:09:25.268
Will it meet all of us at the same time,

00:09:25.292 --> 00:09:27.726
I think, is the variable we are inquiring.

00:09:27.750 --> 00:09:29.750
(Laughter)